    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<p><strong><center>TIDAL FC 6-0 CLASS 5 FC</strong><br><strong><center>场上队长</strong> Z·MARTIN<br><strong><center>全场最佳</strong> S·ZIWEN<br><strong><center>本场战术PLAN B完成度90%</strong></p><center>本场比赛原定时间2023/11/22，因雨雪天气推迟至2023/11/24举行<span id="more"></span><p><strong><center>首发阵容 2-1-3阵</strong><br>门将：L·KASPER<br>后场：Y·DONGYU—W·CHENBO—R·RAMOS<br>中场：Z·BRYANT<br>前场：Z·MARTIN—S·ZIWEN</p><p><strong><center>比赛事件(时间顺序)</strong><br>上半场<br><strong>开球！</strong><br>我方开场积极逼抢Z·MARTIN破门<strong>1-0</strong><br>对方反击L·KASPER因场地积雪解围失误，对方角球<br>对方角球射门打偏<br>我方定位球，位置较远S·ZIWEN下坠弧线球破门 <strong>2-0</strong>此球被评为本场最佳进球！！！<br>对方直塞R·RAMOS破坏，找到前场混战中Z·BRAINT捅射破门<strong>3-0</strong><br>我方机会S·ZIWEN右路突破后传中W·CHENBO铲射未果Z·MARTIN包抄得手<strong>4-0</strong><br>下半场阵型变化<br>门将：Y·DONGYU<br>后场：W·LUCKA——-X·LAMPARD<br>中场：T·CHENYANG客串——-W·CHENBO<br>前场：L·KASPER—-S·ZIWEN<br><strong>开球！</strong><br>我方反击W·CHENBO低射破门<strong>5-0</strong><br>我方机会S·ZIWE调整后重炮轰门得手<strong>6-0</strong><br>对方解围<br>全场比赛结束！</p><p><strong><center>伤情汇报</strong><br>Z·BRYANT腿部伤，预计4天康复</p><p><strong><center>精彩瞬间</strong><br>精彩瞬间：</p><div style="position: relative; width: 100%; height: 0; padding-bottom: 75%;"><iframe src="//player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=408992667&bvid=BV1hG411i7jS&cid=1344754342&p=1" scrolling="no" border="0" frameborder="no" framespacing="0" allowfullscreen="true" style="position: absolute; width: 100%; height: 100%; left: 0; top: 0;"> </iframe></div>]]></content>
    
    
    
